OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry and
OL,6,Ffine evening to come with plenty of
OL,7,Flate sunshine, although slightly more
OL,8,Fin the way of cloud over Cornwall.
OL,9,FCloud spreading to most parts
OL,10,Fovernight. Light winds and feeling
OL,11,Frather mild.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FA grey start in the south but
OL,14,Fcloud will gradually clear, leaving a
OL,15,Ffine and sunny day across the region.
OL,16,FFeeling warm in the sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
